[{"answer":"Hello?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, hello. Is that Julie Davison?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/3.mp3"},{"answer":"This is Greg Preston from the Employment Agency.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/4.mp3"},{"answer":"We met last week when you came in to enquire about office work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Now we've just had some details come in of a job which might interest you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/7.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/8.mp3"},{"answer":"So this is a position for a receptionist,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I believe you've done that sort of work before?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I have,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I worked in a sports centre for a couple of years before I got married and had the children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, this job's in Fordham, so not too far away for you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/14.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's at the medical centre there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/15.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/16.mp3"},{"answer":"So where exactly is that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/17.mp3"},{"answer":"It's quite near the station, on Chastons Road.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Chastons Road,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/20.mp3"},{"answer":"that's C-H-A-S-T-O-N-S.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/21.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/22.mp3"},{"answer":"So what would the work involve?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Dealing with enquiries from patients?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/25.mp3"},{"answer":"and you'd also be involved in making appointments,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/26.mp3"},{"answer":"whether face to face or on the phone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/27.mp3"},{"answer":"And rescheduling them if necessary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine, that shouldn't be a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/29.mp3"},{"answer":"And another of your duties would be keeping the centre's database up-to-date.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Then you might have other general administrative duties as well,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/31.mp3"},{"answer":"but those would be the main ones.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/32.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Now when the details came in, I immediately thought of you","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/34.mp3"},{"answer":"because one thing they do require is someone with experience,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/35.mp3"},{"answer":"and you did mention your work at the sports centre when you came in to see us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, in fact I enjoyed that job.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there anything else they're looking for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, they say it's quite a high-pressure environment,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/39.mp3"},{"answer":"they're always very busy,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/40.mp3"},{"answer":"and patients are often under stress,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/41.mp3"},{"answer":"so they want someone who can cope with that and stay calm,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/42.mp3"},{"answer":"and at the same time be confident when interacting with the public.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, after dealing with three children all under five,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/44.mp3"},{"answer":"I reckon I can cope with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure you can.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/46.mp3"},{"answer":"And then another thing they mention is that they're looking for someone with good IT skills...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Not a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/48.mp3"},{"answer":"So you'd be interested in following this up?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/50.mp3"},{"answer":"When would it start?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, they're looking for someone from the beginning of next month,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/52.mp3"},{"answer":"but I should tell you that this isn't a permanent job,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/53.mp3"},{"answer":"it's temporary, so the contract would be just to the end of September.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/54.mp3"},{"answer":"But they do say that there could be further opportunities after that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/55.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/56.mp3"},{"answer":"And what would the hours be?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, they want someone who can start at 7:45 in the morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you manage that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, my husband would have to get the kids up and off to my mother's,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/60.mp3"},{"answer":"she's going to be looking after them while I'm at work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/61.mp3"},{"answer":"What time would I finish?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/62.mp3"},{"answer":"1:15","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/63.mp3"},{"answer":"That should work out all right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/64.mp3"},{"answer":"I can pick the kids up on my way home,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/65.mp3"},{"answer":"and then I'll have the afternoon with them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, one thing...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/67.mp3"},{"answer":"is there parking available for staff at the centre?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, there is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/69.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's also on a bus route.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I expect I'll have the car but it's good to know that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/72.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, so where do I go from here?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, if you're happy for me to do so,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/74.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll forward your CV and references,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/75.mp3"},{"answer":"and then the best thing would probably be for you to phone them","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/76.mp3"},{"answer":"so they can arrange for an interview.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Great. Well thank you very much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/78.mp3"},{"answer":"You're welcome. Bye now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-1-2023-06-17-19-16-42/80.mp3"}]
